title Employees Submit Expense Claims

component expense-webapp as "Expense Claims Web App" web-application
component expense-api as "Expense Claims API" service
component expense-db as "Claims Database" database

east thunder-app as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> expense-webapp
north -> expense-api

expense-webapp -> expense-api
expense-webapp -> thunder-app
expense-api -> thunder-app
expense-api -> expense-db
